0..77 Comment "// A call nested inside an expression runs first, and its result stands where"
78..96 Comment "// the call stood."
97..99 Comment "//"
100..178 Comment "// A computation is a value only once it runs, so each nested call runs before"
179..252 Comment "// the expression that reads it. A pure run that a value definition holds"
253..321 Comment "// stands as the value it returns. An effectful one there is refused"
322..341 Comment "// `UnenclosedRun`."
342..344 Comment "//"
345..422 Comment "// The checker sequences each nested call before its reader. A call returning"
423..500 Comment "// a function runs before the call it is passed to, and before an application"
501..513 Comment "// in place."
514..516 Comment "//"
517..568 Comment "// - see: #2327 — `passed_alone`, `passed_beside`"
